  "releaseNotes": [
    "V21.3 rebuilds Verified Practice 1–85 as distinct topic-specific bilingual conversations while preserving their existing dialogue and segment IDs.",
    "Verified Practice 86–105 remains protected; two new practice variants are added as dialogue-106 and dialogue-107.",
    "Original Source 1–85 is re-verified against the saved first-source/V18 reference; two supplied candidate-reported 14-segment dialogues are added as original-086 and original-087.",
    "The Hindi library now contains 194 dialogues: 107 Verified Practice + 87 Original Source.",
    "Dialogue-specific vocabulary is rebuilt for all 194 dialogues with 1,891 context-linked records; ambiguous automatic single-word matches require confirmation on both bilingual sides.",
    "Students can mark or unmark Appeared in my test. Protected Firebase Functions use monthly per-dialogue aggregates with per-day counts, without exposing student identities.",
    "Recent can be filtered by This week, Last 30 days, Month or Custom dates, and the two supplied candidate-reported topics can be selected as a dedicated mock pair.",
    "My Vocabs adds a permanent Added date column plus Today, Yesterday, Last 7 days, Last 30 days and Custom date filters that combine with Recall.",
    "The existing assessment, transcription, TTS, Hindi clarity, instant word lookup and V21.2.1 practice controls are preserved.",
    "V21.3.1 also compacts dialogue cards and uses three columns on roomy desktop screens while preserving all progress, Recent-report and practice actions."
